  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Cooperation Health Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the project  is to support the structural reforms in the public health sector of Ukraine. A main objective is to enable the Ukrainian health sector to provide better physical and psychological rehabilitation. The project will also include cooperation in infection protection, as well as specific prevention and treatment programmes of various diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
